INSERT INTO `ragquerylog` (`QueryID`, `MemberID`, `Question`, `GeneratedSQL`, `RetrievedChunks`, `Answer`, `RetrievalTimeMs`, `GenerationTimeMs`, `ExecutionTimeMs`, `TotalTimeMs`, `Status`, `ErrorMessage`, `CreatedAt`) VALUES
(1, 2, 'how many members are in the church now?', 'SELECT COUNT(*) AS `TotalActiveMembers` FROM `Member` AS `m` LEFT JOIN `MembershipActive` AS `ma` ON `ma`.`MemberID` = `m`.`MemberID` WHERE COALESCE(`ma`.`IsActive`, 1) = 1 AND (NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `User` AS `systemUser` WHERE `systemUser`.`MemberID` = `m`.`MemberID` AND `systemUser`.`Role` = \'master_admin\'))', '{\"architecture\":\"structured\",\"chunks\":[{\"chunkId\":110,\"type\":\"business_rule\",\"sourceTable\":\"MembershipActive\",\"text\":\"Business rule: Member active status. To determine whether a church member is active or inactive, use MembershipActive.IsActive. Start from Member and LEFT JOIN MembershipActive on MemberID. Members with no MembershipActive row or NULL IsActive are active by default, matching the dashboard and member list. Filter active members with COALESCE(ma.IsActive, 1) = 1. Example: SELECT COUNT(*) AS ActiveMembers FROM Member m LEFT JOIN MembershipActive ma ON ma.MemberID = m.MemberID WHERE COALESCE(ma.IsActive, 1) = 1. Do not count only rows in MembershipActive for total active church members. TRUE means active. FALSE means inactive. Do not confuse member activity with Subdistrict.IsActive, Unit.IsActive or LifeGroup.IsActive.\",\"score\":0.7057277},{\"chunkId\":42,\"type\":\"table\",\"sourceTable\":\"member\",\"text\":\"Table: member\\nDescription: Stores personal information of registered church members and their assigned life groups.\\nColumns:\\n- MemberID (int(11)) Unique identifier of a member.\\n- LifeGroupID (int(11)) References the life group assigned to the member.\\n- FirstName (varchar(100)) First name of the member.\\n- LastName (varchar(100)) Last name of the member.\\n- Gender (varchar(50)) Gender of the member.\\n- BirthDate (date) Date of birth. Can be used to calculate member age.\\n- MaritalStatus (varchar(50)) Marital status of the member.\\n- Email (varchar(255)) Email address of the member.\\n- JoinDate (date) Date when the member joined the church.\",\"score\":0.6928526},{\"chunkId\":112,\"type\":\"business_rule\",\"sourceTable\":\"Subdistrict\",\"text\":\"Business rule: Church organizational hierarchy. A Subdistrict contains Units. A Unit contains LifeGroups. A LifeGroup can contain multiple Members. Join Subdistrict to Unit using SubdistrictID. Join Unit to LifeGroup using UnitID. Join LifeGroup to Member using LifeGroupID.\",\"score\":0.68384707},{\"chunkId\":51,\"type\":\"column\",\"sourceTable\":\"member\",\"text\":\"Table: member\\nColumn: JoinDate\\nData type: date\\nNullable: YES\\nKey: None\\nDescription: Date when the member joined the church.\",\"score\":0.6745436},{\"chunkId\":111,\"type\":\"business_rule\",\"sourceTable\":\"MemberEngagement\",\"text\":\"Business rule: Member engagement. MemberEngagement stores separate indicators for overall engagement, life group participation, Sunday service participation and serving. These indicators are different from MembershipActive.IsActive. An active church member is not necessarily active in every engagement category.\",\"score\":0.6545038},{\"chunkId\":64,\"type\":\"column\",\"sourceTable\":\"membershipactive\",\"text\":\"Table: membershipactive\\nColumn: IsActive\\nData type: tinyint(1)\\nNullable: NO\\nKey: None\\nDescription: TRUE means the member is active in the church. FALSE means the member is inactive or deactivated.\",\"score\":0.65086377},{\"chunkId\":62,\"type\":\"table\",\"sourceTable\":\"membershipactive\",\"text\":\"Table: membershipactive\\nDescription: Stores whether a member is active or inactive, including deactivation reasons and related information.\\nColumns:\\n- MemberID (int(11)) References the associated member.\\n- IsActive (tinyint(1)) TRUE means the member is active in the church. FALSE means the member is inactive or deactivated.\\n- InactiveReason (enum(\'Transferred University\',\'Moved\',\'Changed Church\',\'Migrant\',\'Personal\',\'Others\')) Reason why the member was deactivated. Allowed values: Transferred University, Moved, Changed Church, Migrant, Personal, Others.\\n- AdditionalNotes (text) Additional information about the member deactivation.\\n- DeactivatedByMemberID (int(11)) References the member who performed the deactivation.\\n- DeactivatedDate (datetime) Date and time when the member was deactivated.\",\"score\":0.6492845},{\"chunkId\":114,\"type\":\"business_rule\",\"sourceTable\":\"ServiceAttendance\",\"text\":\"Business rule: Service attendance. ServiceAttendance stores aggregate attendance counts for each service date and session. AttendanceCount represents a recorded total, not an individual member. The schema does not contain a direct relationship between ServiceAttendance and Member.\",\"score\":0.6492065},{\"chunkId\":69,\"type\":\"table\",\"sourceTable\":\"membershipstatus\",\"text\":\"Table: membershipstatus\\nDescription: Stores membership classification and believer status for each member.\\nColumns:\\n- MemberID (int(11)) References the associated member.\\n- MembershipType (varchar(100)) Membership classification of the member.\\n- BelieverStatus (varchar(100)) Believer status of the member.\",\"score\":0.6479743},{\"chunkId\":97,\"type\":\"relationship\",\"sourceTable\":\"baptism\",\"text\":\"Foreign key relationship: baptism.MemberID references member.MemberID\",\"score\":0.6455648}],\"traversalPaths\":[]}', 'There are 969 active members in the church.', 1011, 2174, 34, 3367, 'success', NULL, '2026-10-26 01:49:55'),
(2, 1, 'how many people in church', 'SELECT COUNT(*) AS `TotalActiveMembers` FROM `Member` AS `m` LEFT JOIN `MembershipActive` AS `ma` ON `ma`.`MemberID` = `m`.`MemberID` WHERE COALESCE(`ma`.`IsActive`, 1) = 1 AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `User` AS `u` WHERE `u`.`MemberID` = `m`.`MemberID` AND `u`.`Role` = \'master_admin\') AND (NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `User` AS `systemUser` WHERE `systemUser`.`MemberID` = `m`.`MemberID` AND `systemUser`.`Role` = \'master_admin\'))', '{\"architecture\":\"structured\",\"chunks\":[{\"chunkId\":110,\"type\":\"business_rule\",\"sourceTable\":\"MembershipActive\",\"text\":\"Business rule: Member active status. To determine whether a church member is active or inactive, use MembershipActive.IsActive. Start from Member and LEFT JOIN MembershipActive on MemberID. Members with no MembershipActive row or NULL IsActive are active by default, matching the dashboard and member list. Filter active members with COALESCE(ma.IsActive, 1) = 1. Example: SELECT COUNT(*) AS ActiveMembers FROM Member m LEFT JOIN MembershipActive ma ON ma.MemberID = m.MemberID WHERE COALESCE(ma.IsActive, 1) = 1. Do not count only rows in MembershipActive for total active church members. TRUE means active. FALSE means inactive. Do not confuse member activity with Subdistrict.IsActive, Unit.IsActive or LifeGroup.IsActive.\",\"score\":0.6626396},{\"chunkId\":76,\"type\":\"table\",\"sourceTable\":\"serviceattendance\",\"text\":\"Table: serviceattendance\\nDescription: Stores aggregate church service attendance by service date and session.\\nColumns:\\n- AttendanceID (int(11)) Unique identifier of an attendance record.\\n- ServiceDate (date) Date of the church service.\\n- SessionTime (varchar(50)) Session time of the church service.\\n- AttendanceCount (int(11)) Aggregate number of attendees for the service session.\\n- Remarks (text) Additional attendance notes.\",\"score\":0.65113634},{\"chunkId\":112,\"type\":\"business_rule\",\"sourceTable\":\"Subdistrict\",\"text\":\"Business rule: Church organizational hierarchy. A Subdistrict contains Units. A Unit contains LifeGroups. A LifeGroup can contain multiple Members. Join Subdistrict to Unit using SubdistrictID. Join Unit to LifeGroup using UnitID. Join LifeGroup to Member using LifeGroupID.\",\"score\":0.6439718},{\"chunkId\":111,\"type\":\"business_rule\",\"sourceTable\":\"MemberEngagement\",\"text\":\"Business rule: Member engagement. MemberEngagement stores separate indicators for overall engagement, life group participation, Sunday service participation and serving. These indicators are different from MembershipActive.IsActive. An active church member is not necessarily active in every engagement category.\",\"score\":0.6435822},{\"chunkId\":42,\"type\":\"table\",\"sourceTable\":\"member\",\"text\":\"Table: member\\nDescription: Stores personal information of registered church members and their assigned life groups.\\nColumns:\\n- MemberID (int(11)) Unique identifier of a member.\\n- LifeGroupID (int(11)) References the life group assigned to the member.\\n- FirstName (varchar(100)) First name of the member.\\n- LastName (varchar(100)) Last name of the member.\\n- Gender (varchar(50)) Gender of the member.\\n- BirthDate (date) Date of birth. Can be used to calculate member age.\\n- MaritalStatus (varchar(50)) Marital status of the member.\\n- Email (varchar(255)) Email address of the member.\\n- JoinDate (date) Date when the member joined the church.\",\"score\":0.6428665},{\"chunkId\":80,\"type\":\"column\",\"sourceTable\":\"serviceattendance\",\"text\":\"Table: serviceattendance\\nColumn: AttendanceCount\\nData type: int(11)\\nNullable: NO\\nKey: None\\nDescription: Aggregate number of attendees for the service session.\",\"score\":0.64088035},{\"chunkId\":114,\"type\":\"business_rule\",\"sourceTable\":\"ServiceAttendance\",\"text\":\"Business rule: Service attendance. ServiceAttendance stores aggregate attendance counts for each service date and session. AttendanceCount represents a recorded total, not an individual member. The schema does not contain a direct relationship between ServiceAttendance and Member.\",\"score\":0.6385329},{\"chunkId\":51,\"type\":\"column\",\"sourceTable\":\"member\",\"text\":\"Table: member\\nColumn: JoinDate\\nData type: date\\nNullable: YES\\nKey: None\\nDescription: Date when the member joined the church.\",\"score\":0.6130786},{\"chunkId\":79,\"type\":\"column\",\"sourceTable\":\"serviceattendance\",\"text\":\"Table: serviceattendance\\nColumn: SessionTime\\nData type: varchar(50)\\nNullable: NO\\nKey: None\\nDescription: Session time of the church service.\",\"score\":0.6099514},{\"chunkId\":52,\"type\":\"table\",\"sourceTable\":\"memberengagement\",\"text\":\"Table: memberengagement\\nDescription: Stores member engagement indicators for life group participation, Sunday service participation and serving.\\nColumns:\\n- MemberID (int(11)) References the associated member.\\n- IsActiveEngage (tinyint(1)) Overall member engagement indicator.\\n- IsActiveLifeGroup (tinyint(1)) Indicates active participation in a life group.\\n- IsActiveSundayService (tinyint(1)) Indicates active participation in Sunday services.\\n- IsActiveServing (tinyint(1)) Indicates active involvement in serving.\",\"score\":0.6068238}],\"traversalPaths\":[]}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2368, 'failed', 'Access denied for user \'church_rag\'@\'localhost\' (using password: YES)', '2026-10-26 10:24:57'),
